# dev-engine (headless test loop) runtime artifacts — never committed.
# The pid file + logs are per-run local state; the test instance's cache lives
# under ~/.cache/ (out of tree). config.copilot-test.toml IS committed (the rig).
.dev-engine.pid
.dev-engine.out.log
.dev-engine.err.log